  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Connections - for the Global Goals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information activities in Norway related to gender equality and SDG. The goal of the project is to show how gender equality can contribute to the entire sustainability agenda.</narrative>
